# Plan todos: quadruples + micro backlog

1. Tag every todo `[REQ]` | `[AC]` | `[TEST]` | `[EDGE]`.
2. Prefer a **large micro-todo backlog** (often 15–40+), one checkable unit each (`req-01-…`, …).
3. Never collapse to four fat rollups or a vague 4–12 “outcome-only” list when the work has clear slices.
4. Frontmatter `todos:` is SSOT. Body may keep a short rollup criteria table.
5. `lean-blast-radius` = small **code** blast radius on implement — **not** fewer plan todos.
